  "solution": {
    "text": "It total voltage across <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math> is <math><mn>220</mn></math> then voltage across <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math> should be <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>220</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mn>55</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math> (voltage to be measured)<br /><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/ci/image25-360e2eb3-6ae3-4c27-9ab8-80dfaf9a015a.jpg\" style=\"max-width:\"100%\"; object-fit:contain\" style=\"height: 159px; width: 280px;\" /><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">′</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>220</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>2000</mn></mrow><mn>11000</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mn>40</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math> (voltage being measured)<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>∴</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">′</mi></mrow><mi>V</mi></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mn>100</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>55</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>40</mn></mrow><mn>55</mn></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mn>100</mn><mo>=27%</mo></math>",
